{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last tank rolls in...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/57fd4feb2053693e7a7cc9badc739a46.apng?t=1750784973\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/57fd4feb2053693e7a7cc9badc739a46.poster.avif?t=1750784973\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and it brought extra lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Golgalian</i>, the world's most powerful tank and last hope against the mech horde! Intense action, endless enemies, and scorching sands await in a mission that never gets easier. Dodge barrages of lasers and mortar fire, use the environment to your advantage, and melt steel with unprecedented firepower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced shooting combat in a bullet hell for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique power-ups for maximum shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly escalating difficulty in an endless level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted, tactical enemy formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard for high score hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two biomes: Sand and Road!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defender of Albuquerque","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593430/83a975a628cb8c850c0740b57c5fd31b4bdd7ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Hero of New Mexico","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593430/8f3d4ed48170d35eca1b409577d4d5b19ea85430.jpg"},{"name":"Scourge of Mechkind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593430/9c87